"┌Every 0s:┌ Help ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐─────────┐"
"│         │ /  press / to filter settings and keys                                                                               │         │"
"│ N/A     │ Settings                                                                                                             │         │"
"│         │ Interval           5s             Timeout            1m             Max history        10                            │         │"
"│         │ Default display    RawText        Wrap               on             Zen                off                           │         │"
"│         │ Beep               off            Exit on error      off            Exit on change     off                           │         │"
"│         │ Log level          off            Theme              system         Collapse borders   off                           │         │"
"│         │ Show state         off            Show last updated  off            Show display type  on                            │         │"
"│         │ Show history meter on             Show status bar    on             Inline deletions   off                           │         │"
