"│         │ Tab      cycle                       c        enter cmd mode                                                         │         │"
"│         │ Esc      escape                      Shift-d  enter display select mode   OBSERVE                                    │         │"
"│         │ Down     move down                   ?        enter help mode             n        next match                        │         │"
"│         │ Left     move left                   o        enter observe mode          Shift-n  prev match                        │         │"
