"│         │ Up       move up                     Shift-s  enter session save mode     g        scroll top                        │         │"
"│         │ q        quit                        Space    execute                     /        search                            │         │"
"│         │                                      d        interval decrease           w        wrap toggle                       │         │"
"│         │ SESSION LOAD                         i        interval increase                                                      │         │"
"│         │ Ctrl-d   delete                      x        kill pane                   HELP                                       │         │"
"│         │ Ctrl-r   rename                      l        load latest session         Shift-g  scroll bottom                     │         │"
